<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Oct CPI up 1.4 pct m/m, 21.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Oct CPI up 1.4 pct m/m, 21.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian consumer prices rose 1.4 percent in October over September and were up 21.0 percent on a year-on-year basis, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (CPI)</p>
<p>				   Oct 96     Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month (pct)   +1.4	  +1.4	 +2.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year (pct)    +21.0	 +22.2	+29.0</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
